  "problems": "The UK URL pieces.com/en-gb/sizeguide/ shows 'page not found'; the footer 'Size guide' link redirects to the en-fr page used here (English text). There is no jeans waist/hip table: jeans sizes 24-34 are only mapped to letters and a 'Numeric' (assumed EU) size in the Size converter, with letters rowspanned (M covers 28-30); jeans fits must go through the letter body chart. The body chart lists Inseam 80 for every size. The 'Numeric' column is not labelled EU on the page; stored as alias 'eu' with that caveat. The jeans leg-length table gives 86.3 for 34\" where Pepe/Lee give 86.4; copied as published."
